  build:["Squeeze the muscle, don't just move the weight.", "Chase the pump, not the ego.", "Slow on the way down. That's where it grows.", "Full range, full stretch, full squeeze.", "Feel the target muscle working before adding weight.", "Two seconds down, a pause, then lift.", "Last reps should be hard but still clean.", "Mind on the muscle. Count each squeeze."],
  sprint:["Full rest, full speed. Quality over quantity.", "Tall hips, fast arms.", "Every rep is a race. Win it.", "Relaxed face, relaxed shoulders, fast legs.", "Push the ground back, don't reach forward.", "Rest until you can go 100% again.", "Drive the knees, punch the arms.", "Stop the session when the speed drops."],
  athlete:["Explode on every rep. Game speed only.", "Land soft, leave fast.", "Strong and quick. That's the whole game.", "Stick every landing before the next rep.", "Short ground contact. Bounce off the floor.", "Train like the game's on the line.", "Power first, then strength, then conditioning.", "If it's slow, it's not power. Reset and go again."],
  fighter:["Hands up, keep breathing.", "Finish the round stronger than you started.", "Champions are built in rounds like this one.", "Exhale on every strike.", "Stay light on your feet; never flat-footed.", "Tired? That's when technique matters most.", "Chin down, eyes up, keep moving.", "Last ten seconds of the round: all out."]
